Ocean Cliff Villa
share
Marrying an idyllic natural landscape with Italianate refinement, eight one-bedroom Ocean Cliff Villas are perched closest to the cliff’s edge amid a dense tropical garden and sit within a traditional Balinese entry and a high stone wall for optimal privacy. The shimmering Indian Ocean occupies the full panoramic view from the expansive shaded outdoor living room with an elegant minibar, a personal infinity-edge swimming pool, and sumptuous sun beds.

 

Inside the villa, a spacious glass and mahogany-toned jewel box, operable glass doors can open to the fresh sea breeze. Beneath a stately pitched ceiling, the plush king bed is dressed in fine linens and textiles handmade in Klungkung, Bali. Additional upholstered furnishings offer restful places to lounge amid vibrant woven pillows and curated antiques from around the Indonesian archipelago. A large closet gives way to a prodigious, glass-clad terrazzo bathroom surrounded by verdant flora and featuring a generous bathtub, standalone shower, and double vanity with the complete Bvlgari fragrance and bath collection.